:false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-14T18:22:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T08:21:31Z","closed_at":"2026-08-09T08:21:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.6.2.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9579) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads) - 15.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nPressing the `Bake NavigationPolygon` context button on a `NavigationRegion2D` bakes a `NavigationPolygon` that only takes the edges of the `NavigationRegion2D` itself into account, completely ignoring any instances of `TileMapLayer`, `StaticBody2D`, etc.\n\nEdit: Tested with the dedicated `NavigationObstacle2D` node (with `Carve Navigation Mesh` enabled) and it's broken as well.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new 2D scene\n2. Add a `NavigationRegion2D` under the root `Node2D`\n3. Create a new `NavigationPolygon` for the `NavigationRegion2D`\n4. Draw an arbitrary shape for the `NavigationRegion2D` (e.g. a large square)\n5. Create a new `StaticBody2D`\n6. Create a new `CollisionShape2D` under the `StaticBody2D`\n7. Set an arbitrary collision shape (e.g. a rectangle) for the `CollisionShape2D` that is within the `NavigationRegion2D`\n8. Hit the `Bake NavigationPolygon` button on the `NavigationRegion2D`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[NavigationRegion2DBakingTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27771847/NavigationRegion2DBakingTest.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119467/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}